  "subject": "a woman staying over at her boyfriend's flat who writes masking-tape labels for every unmarked jar in his kitchen, and he keeps them all even the wrong ones",
  "caption": "Cantonese lo-fi soul, Hong Kong bedroom R&B in the 2025 indie vein. Warm Rhodes electric piano chords with gentle tremolo; round muted electric bass; lazy brushed drums slightly behind the beat; soft nylon guitar fills. Tape-saturated lo-fi mix with light vinyl hiss and warm low end. Female alto, close-mic, relaxed breathy delivery. 82 BPM, E-flat major. Warm, sleepy and quietly in love. No trap hi-hats, no autotune, no EDM build, no big ballad belting.",
  "lyrics": "[Verse]\n你廚房啲樽冇名冇姓\n白色粉末排咗一行\n我拎卷紙膠紙同支筆\n坐喺地下逐樽試吓聞\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n鹽定係糖我舔一啖\n你笑我似隻貓\n\n[Chorus]\n呢樽寫胡椒 嗰樽寫麻油\n歪歪斜斜我嘅字\n你話你睇得明\n我就寫多一樽\n\n[Verse]\n有樽我寫咗係雞粉\n原來係洗碗機嘅鹽\n你冇撕走嗰張膠紙\n只係喺下面加個問號\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n我話撕咗佢啦\n你話留低做證據\n\n[Chorus]\n呢樽寫胡椒 嗰樽寫麻油\n寫錯嗰張你最鍾意\n你話你睇得明\n我就留多一晚\n\n[Verse]\n今朝你煮咗兩隻蛋\n伸手就拎啱嗰樽鹽\n你望住我嘅字講早晨\n好似講緊我個名\n\n[Bridge]\n膠紙會黃 字會甩\n你話到時再寫過\n\n[Chorus]\n呢樽寫胡椒 嗰樽寫麻油\n我嘅字貼滿你屋企\n你話你睇得明\n我就唔使再走\n\n[Outro]\n最後一樽冇寫字\n留返畀你寫我個名",
